<title>POLAND: Polish NBP buys marks at PLN 1.8040 - dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP buys marks at PLN 1.8040 - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) bought marks on the interbank market at 1.8040 zlotys, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention, described as &quot;medium,&quot; came at 1230 GMT when the zloty was around 2.85 percent from Wednesday's average weighted dollar and mark parity rates, the centre of the daily 14-percent trading band.</p>
<p>Earlier, the NBP bought dollars at 3.0486, 3.0360, 3.0355 and 3.0337 zlotys, dealers said. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
